## Description

 This function demonstrates various link types. See [`simple`](https://rdrr.io/r/base/simple.html) for a simpler example. Also see [`stats::lm`](https://rdrr.io/pkg/stats/man/lm.html) for linear models. 

## Usage

```r
with_links(data)
```

## Arguments

::: {.list-table header-rows=1}

- - Argument
  - Description

- - `data`
  - A data frame. See [`base::data.frame`](https://rdrr.io/pkg/base/man/data.frame.html).

:::

## See Also

[`simple`](https://rdrr.io/r/base/simple.html), [`ggplot2::ggplot`](https://rdrr.io/pkg/ggplot2/man/ggplot.html)

## Examples

```{r}
with_links(mtcars)
```
